- LevelBackgroundFrame.board (optional 2D grid rect) passed by ManagedMobileBoardUI; LakesideBoardBackground.frame() writes the aligned pose (only camera call changed)
- lakeside-scene.cjs mirrors lakesideSceneInstances; K6 rewritten for 2D-board alignment on 8 BoardLayout layouts

